          </td>
          <td style="border-bottom: 0px; border-left: 0px; border-right: 0px; border-top: 0px; padding: 4pt 2pt 2pt 3pt; vertical-align: top">
                        <p class="CellBodyC">1 per store front</p>

          </td>
          <td style="border-bottom: 0px; border-left: 0px; border-right: 0px; border-top: 0px; padding: 4pt 2pt 2pt 3pt; vertical-align: top">
                        <p class="CellBodyC">25</p>

          </td>
          <td style="border-bottom: 0px; border-left: 0px; border-right: 0px; border-top: 0px; padding: 4pt 2pt 2pt 3pt; vertical-align: top">
                        <p class="CellBodyC">1 sq. ft. to 1 linear foot of primary commercial frontage &ndash; 100 sq. ft. max<span class="Superscript">3</span></p>

          </td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td style="border-bottom: 0px; border-left: 0px; border-right: 0px; border-top: 1px solid #000000; padding: 4pt 2pt 2pt 3pt; vertical-align: top">
                        <p class="CellBody">&nbsp;</p>

          </td>
          <td style="border-bottom: 0px; border-left: 0px; border-right: 0px; border-top: 1px solid #000000; padding: 4pt 2pt 2pt 3pt; vertical-align: top">
                        <p class="CellBody">Freestanding Type A</p>

          </td>
          <td style="border-bottom: 0px; border-left: 0px; border-right: 0px; border-top: 1px solid #000000; padding: 4pt 2pt 2pt 3pt; vertical-align: top">
                        <p class="CellBodyC">Limited by frontage line length</p>

          </td>
          <td style="border-bottom: 0px; border-left: 0px; border-right: 0px; border-top: 1px solid #000000; padding: 4pt 2pt 2pt 3pt; vertical-align: top">
                        <p class="CellBodyC">10</p>

          </td>
          <td style="border-bottom: 0px; border-left: 0px; border-right: 0px; border-top: 1px solid #000000; padding: 4pt 2pt 2pt 3pt; vertical-align: top">
